.page wait 1 wait for processes to finish

# SYNOPSIS
*wait* [_PID_]

# DESCRIPTION
`wait` is a gapsh builtin. With a process id it waits for that process and returns its exit status; without one it waits for all child processes.

# EXAMPLES
    sleep 2 & wait $!; echo done

# SEE ALSO
jobs(1), kill(1)
